WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
The mixed-maturity example moves
from three hundred hours to two hundred

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:07.600
and twenty-two. That is seventy-eight
hours of gross capacity,

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:10.480
with forty hours of review
already included in the target.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.200
It is conditional arithmetic,
not observed AI impact.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.960
The adoption prerequisites
remain unverified, and tool,

00:00:19.013 --> 00:00:22.080
cloud and vendor charges
are outside this comparison.

00:00:22.253 --> 00:00:25.200
Treat the result as a hypothesis to test.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:30.160
Turning capacity into financial value
requires a separate, agreed plan.
